# Frontend pre-commit hook (Husky 9.x format)
#
# Runs `lint-staged` which lints + auto-formats only the files actually staged
# for this commit. Fast (~1-2 sec) — see lint-staged config in package.json.
#
# Type-check and the full test suite are not run here because they are slower.
# Run the local validation commands from README.md before sharing changes.
#
# To temporarily skip this hook (e.g., WIP commits): `git commit --no-verify`
# Don't make a habit of it — bypassing the hook means broken code can land.

npx lint-staged
